ize:3.6cqw;white-space:nowrap\">▶ In progress</span><span style=\"display:{{eq(data.status, 'blocked', 'inline-flex', 'none')}};color:#b91c1c;font-weight:800;font-size:3.6cqw;white-space:nowrap\">■ Blocked</span><span style=\"display:{{eq(data.status, 'waiting', 'inline-flex', 'none')}};color:#92400e;font-weight:800;font-size:3.6cqw;white-space:nowrap\">… Waiting</span><span style=\"display:{{eq(data.status, 'done', 'inline-flex', 'none')}};color:#166534;font-weight:800;font-size:3.6cqw;white-space:nowrap\">✓ Done</span><span style=\"display:{{eq(data.status, 'achieved', 'inline-flex', 'none')}};color:#166534;font-weight:800;font-size:3.6cqw;white-space:nowrap\">✓ Achieved</span><span style=\"display:{{eq(data.status, 'cancelled', 'inline-flex', 'none')}};color:#64748b;font-weight:800;font-size:3.6cqw;white-space:nowrap\">× Cancelled</span><span style=\"display:{{eq(data.status, 'answered', 'inline-flex', 'none')}};color:#166534;font-weight:800;font-size:3.6cqw;white-space:nowrap\">✓ Answered</span><span style=\"display:{{eq(data.status, 'proposed', 'inline-flex', 'none')}};color:#475569;font-weight:800;font-size:3.6cqw;white-space:nowrap\">○ Proposed</span><span style=\"display:{{eq(data.status, 'decided', 'inline-flex', 'none')}};color:#166534;font-weight:800;font-size:3.6cqw;white-space:nowrap\">✓ Decided</span><span style=\"display:{{eq(data.status, 'accepted', 'inline-flex', 'none')}};color:#166534;font-weight:800;font-size:3.6cqw;white-space:nowrap\">✓ Accepted</span><span style=\"display:{{eq(data.status, 'review', 'inline-flex', 'none')}};color:#6d28d9;font-weight:800;font-size:3.6cqw;white-space:nowrap\">◎ Review</span></div></div></div>",
